
INCIDENT ID: INC-2026-107
Service: Booking API
Severity: Medium

Issue:
Booking API returned HTTP 404 when retrieving an existing booking.

Expected:
HTTP 200 with booking details.

Actual:
HTTP 404 Not Found.

Root Cause:
A deployment introduced an incorrect booking ID mapping.

Resolution:
The booking lookup mapping was corrected.

QA Validation:
Verified that existing bookings return HTTP 200.
Verified that nonexistent bookings return HTTP 404.
